[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6044302697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124230#issuecomment-6044302697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124230","id":6044302697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaES9aQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T18:32:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T18:32:18Z","body":"This is not a bug, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13617","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6044302697/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6054916803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124230#issuecomment-6054916803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124230","id":6054916803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaOayww","user":{"login":"Begalov","id":437009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAwOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov","html_url":"https://github.com/Begalov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Begalov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-08T07:28:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T07:28:50Z","body":"@KoBeWi \n\nwell, I have Area3d with 1,9,13 mask layers selected \n\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"102\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34ca2fcc-3073-4aba-85bd-92d9a8cb698b\" />\n\nNext I have to create PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D with collision_mask: int = 0xFFFFFFFF\n\n```\nvar collision_mask: int = (1 << (1 - 1)) | (1 << (9 - 1)) | (1 << (13 - 1))\nPhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.create(ray_start, ray_end, collision_mask)\n\n````\n\nIs it convenient?\n\nBit mask should be copied to clipbord from Layer or Mask property caption or Copy Value context menue item should be disabled.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6054916803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6057419609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124230#issuecomment-6057419609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124230","id":6057419609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaQzjWQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-08T10:01:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T10:01:19Z","body":"> Bit mask should be copied to clipbord from Layer or Mask property caption or Copy Value context menue item should be disabled.\n\nIt is copied, to inspector's internal clipboard. You can paste it into another property.\n\nYou can follow the proposal I linked above. Until it's implemented, you can use this simple plugin as a workaround:\n```GDScript\nclass CopyTexter extends EditorContextMenuPlugin:\n\tfunc _popup_menu(paths: PackedStringArray) -> void:\n\t\tadd_context_menu_item(\"Copy Value as Text\", copy_text)\n\t\t\n\t\tif DisplayServer.clipboard_has():\n\t\t\tadd_context_menu_item(\"Paste Value from Text\", paste_text)\n\t\n\tfunc copy_text(property: EditorProperty):\n\t\tDisplayServer.clipboard_set(var_to_str(property.get_edited_object().get(property.get_edited_property())))\n\t\n\tfunc paste_text(property: EditorProperty):\n\t\tproperty.get_edited_object().set(property.get_edited_property(), str_to_var(DisplayServer.clipboard_get()))\n```\n(register it with `add_context_menu_plugin()` in an addon)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6057419609/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]